  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Adm 1002.10 \"Presiding judge\" means a judge of a New Hampshire court with the authority to order state payment of defense services or expenses.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Adm 1000) #8697, eff 8-3-06; ss by #9149, eff 5-1-08 (from Adm 1002.07); ss by #10728, eff 11-25-14; ss by #13050, eff 7-1-20 (formerly Adm 1002.08)",
